    "Mille means one thousand, hence the ×1000 scaling. CPM measures cost of reach only and says nothing about clicks or conversions." : "Mille significa mil, de ahí el factor de escala ×1000. El CPM mide solo el costo de alcance y no dice nada sobre clics o conversiones.",
